OSS Document Scanner — document edge detection
https://github.com/ossappscollective/OSS-DocumentScanner

The document scanner's edge detection (app/src/main/java/com/readfilestech/read_files_tech/
data/scanner/: ScanImages.kt, ScanEdges.kt, ScanContours.kt, ScanPolygons.kt, DocumentDetector.kt)
is ported to Kotlin from OSS Document Scanner's still-photo detection (cpp/src/DocumentDetector.cpp),
read at commit 83fd6db8dbf5d46658e182fe7211523473fd5dcd.

